{
    "title": "Live Star: YOYO Doll Dress Up",
    "description": "Discover the makeover world of fashion and fun in LIVE STAR: YOYO Doll Dress Up Games! \ud83d\udc57 Immerse yourself in an interactive magic princess universe where you can style, makeup, and dress up! \r\n\r\nDRESS UP AND SHOWCASE YOUR STYLE \ud83c\udf80\r\nDress up your Paper Princess in trendy outfits. Get Creative with Makeup and Personalize Your DIY Paper Doll! Transform the princess doll with a stunning makeover, dress up in fashion, and perfect princess look with exquisite makeup. Flaunt your fashion paper doll sense, snap a photo, and share it with your virtual friends circle!\r\n\r\nINTERACTIVE LIVE BROADCASTS \ud83d\udcfa\r\nGet your princess paper doll ready to shine in the live room after dressing up! Experience the live makeover of a super idol through interactive streaming, winning the love of fans who like makeup.\r\n\r\nFIERCE FASHION BATTLES \ud83c\udfc6\r\nEnter into the makeover world of competitive makeup and dress up! Pick your star idol character and shine in thrilling fashion battles with other stylists! Turn anime princess doll into a idol star and you can become the super stylist everyone admires.\r\nWith the live idol makeover PK feature, stride confidently on the ramp of fashion in a 2D anime yoyo doll dress up game world with a beauty makeup that leaves spectators awestruck. Transform a Paper Doll with Fashionable Makeup in the Ultimate Style Challenge! Dress up, makeup, and makeover to standout in every outfit makeover clash! Live out your paper doll princess fashion dreams and give your Live Star a makeover! \r\n\r\nVIRTUAL SOCIAL CIRCLE\r\nOur makeup game offers a virtual social platform for players to mingle, meet new friends and share their dress up and makeup styling adventures. Players can share their outfits and makeup experiences here and interact with other players!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc84 Packed with 2D cartoon princess style makeover girl games, live broadcasting elements, thrilling dress up challenges and a virtual social network, it\u2019s not just a dress up game, it\u2019s your very own fashion runway!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc83 Step into this fashion paper doll makeover world, download LIVE STAR: YOYO Doll Dress Up Games and let your fashion princess style shine! Become a shining makeover master \u2013 the makeup journey starts here!\r\n\r\n\u2728Contact Us\u2728\r\n\u2013 FB Group: https://www.facebook.com/groups/152003920448574\r\n\u2013 Email: yoyogames.studio@gmail.com\r\n\u2013 Youtube: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCSAAS6shg37jLQGd4GhqvAA",
    "descriptionHTML": "Discover the makeover world of fashion and fun in LIVE STAR: YOYO Doll Dress Up Games! \ud83d\udc57 Immerse yourself in an interactive magic princess universe where you can style, makeup, and dress up! <br><br>DRESS UP AND SHOWCASE YOUR STYLE \ud83c\udf80<br>Dress up your Paper Princess in trendy outfits. Get Creative with Makeup and Personalize Your DIY Paper Doll! Transform the princess doll with a stunning makeover, dress up in fashion, and perfect princess look with exquisite makeup. Flaunt your fashion paper doll sense, snap a photo, and share it with your virtual friends circle!<br><br>INTERACTIVE LIVE BROADCASTS \ud83d\udcfa<br>Get your princess paper doll ready to shine in the live room after dressing up! Experience the live makeover of a super idol through interactive streaming, winning the love of fans who like makeup.<br><br>FIERCE FASHION BATTLES \ud83c\udfc6<br>Enter into the makeover world of competitive makeup and dress up! Pick your star idol character and shine in thrilling fashion battles with other stylists! Turn anime princess doll into a idol star and you can become the super stylist everyone admires.<br>With the live idol makeover PK feature, stride confidently on the ramp of fashion in a 2D anime yoyo doll dress up game world with a beauty makeup that leaves spectators awestruck. Transform a Paper Doll with Fashionable Makeup in the Ultimate Style Challenge! Dress up, makeup, and makeover to standout in every outfit makeover clash! Live out your paper doll princess fashion dreams and give your Live Star a makeover! <br><br>VIRTUAL SOCIAL CIRCLE<br>Our makeup game offers a virtual social platform for players to mingle, meet new friends and share their dress up and makeup styling adventures. Players can share their outfits and makeup experiences here and interact with other players!<br><br>\ud83d\udc84 Packed with 2D cartoon princess style makeover girl games, live broadcasting elements, thrilling dress up challenges and 